+- Resumed relaunches wait the full grace; only fresh keyless `StartAgent` uses the early gate: `keyless_start_gate` (src/reconcile/herdr_exec.rs:38) is consulted from the start path (line 600); `RelaunchOccupant` keeps the `relaunch_grace` deferral (line 753). Matches.
