+- hg-lnw.23 pane-qualified agent-name retry: src/herdr/client.rs:52, 580, 626. Matches.
+- hg-lnw.25 floor note: `daemon_floor` (src/threads/adapter.rs:227) refuses below 3.6.0 with the quoted text, `discover` applies it (line 263), and compose maps the `Unsupported` discovery error to `ThreadsError::Disconnected` (src/daemon/compose.rs:778-782), so "a retryable disconnect" is accurate; doctor recognises the text (src/daemon/doctor.rs:113).
